WEBVTT

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:15.520
I, My, Me! Strawberry-eggs

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:13.680
Tsuyu ake mae no aozora wa...

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:21.600
makes a heart dance with expectation

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:21.600
hitoashi hayaku kokoro wo odoraseru

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:29.080
Summer is coming yet again

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:29.080
Kotoshi mo mosugu natsuga kuru

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:37.510
The city and people are coming to life bursting with joy

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:37.510
Machi mo hito mo ukare kibun de zawameki dasu

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:46.630
A man who's grown up without losing his boyish heart

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:46.630
Shonen no kokoro no mama otona ni natta hito

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:55.360
We can't go back to the day we met for the first time, but...

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:55.360
Futari deatta anohi ni modorenai kedo...

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:05.100
If I close my eyes, I can see your smiling face

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:05.100
Hitomi wo tojireba hohoemu kao ga mieru

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:08.980
The song we both loved. Do you still sing it?

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:13.010
Daisuki na ano uta. Ima mo utatte masuka?

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:20.850
I can still hear that gentle voice and melody

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:20.850
Watashi ni wa kikoeru. Yasashii koe to melody

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:30.130
During times of sadness, I will remember you

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:30.130
Yowaki na toki hodo anata wo omoidasu

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:51.310
How lame!

00:01:51.370 --> 00:01:54.830
Another great job the Vice-Principal found for us.

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:59.950
She sees men as nothing
more than janitors for the school.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.040
Calm down.

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:04.400
But don't worry,
it won't be this way forever!

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:09.050
Hey, be careful with that!

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:09.980
I'm sorry.

00:02:10.410 --> 00:02:11.560
Hibiki-chan!

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:14.510
It's not fair that only the boys
have to clean everything up.

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:16.120
So I came by to help out.

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:18.280
Yeah! That's our Hibiki-chan!

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:22.080
Hey there girls!

00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:23.810
Hibiki-sensei!

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:25.080
What are you doing?

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.960
What does it look like?
We're cleaning.

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:32.910
Starting next month, you'll also be using
the pool, so why don't you help us out?

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:36.090
What? That's a man's job.

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:42.110
The Vice-Principal wouldn't be very
pleased if we started doing man's work.

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:45.120
Hey, it has nothing
to do with gender.

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:50.010
Help us or else!

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:55.970
I'm sorry, Kuzuha!

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:57.540
Are you all right?!

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:00.910
I'm fine.
Don't worry about me.

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:07.750
4th Period
Delicate Tear Concealer

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:10.660
Principal's Office

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:09.740
A parent weekend?!

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:13.610
There's no reason for
you to be so surprised.

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:16.030
It happens every year at this time.

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:17.320
Please forgive me.

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:21.340
Of course, since many of our
students live in the campus dormitory...

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:24.720
a weekend visit is a good opportunity for parents to...

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:27.190
come observe their children's lives at school.

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:31.780
But there is a problem.

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:34.480
That man will come as well.

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:37.250
Yes. That man will come.

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:42.820
Hello.

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:45.320
Hello Principal! This is Tokugawa!

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:47.520
Oh, hello there Director.

00:03:48.150 --> 00:03:51.670
I was thinking that it's about time
for another parent weekend.

00:03:52.230 --> 00:03:56.410
I looking forward to seeing the fruits
of your "female education" program.

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:58.740
You're always so proud of it.

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:02.200
You must be conducting
wonderful classes...

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:04.770
that we men are utterly
incapable of teaching.

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:06.510
Thank you for the complement.

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:09.240
We will get back to you with a date
as soon as possible.

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:13.650
I realize it must be a nuisance for you
to contact a man like me.

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:18.050
That man is impossible!

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:21.220
He'll try to find something
to complain about.

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:24.290
He hates the fact, that we don't have any male teachers here.

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:27.520
At any rate, which class will he be coming to inspect?

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:29.140
According to the schedule...

00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:32.380
2-Indigo

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:31.520
it's the Indigo class' turn this year.

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:41.390
The Parent Visit

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:35.900
All right everybody, settle down.

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:39.210
This Saturday, we're going
have a special gym class...

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:41.450
so make sure you tell your family to be on time.

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:44.120
But I really don't want
my parents to show up.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:46.820
That's no good! The more come,
the more exciting it'll be!

00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:48.750
So make sure to write it in a memo!

00:04:58.470 --> 00:05:01.120
Amawa-sensei, the Vice-Principal would like to see you.

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:02.800
Please go to the faculty room.

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:05.560
Love is All

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:08.670
Of all the classes to inspect,
it has to be Amawa's.

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:13.450
But Principal, shouldn't we have
him inspect some other class!

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:16.060
We follow the same order every year.

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:18.730
It would only raise his suspicion
if we'd change now.

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:20.100
I know that but...

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:23.760
While it is true that Amawa-sensei
is somewhat problematic...

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:26.960
she is not completely
incompetent as a teacher.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:32.000
I can't help thinking that the Principal
is being too soft on Hibiki Amawa.

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:33.020
Vice-Principal.

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:34.390
What is it?

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:36.330
Amawa-sensei.

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:39.490
I have to tell you something, about the upcoming parent visit.

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:40.810
Yes?

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:44.410
It's parent's weekend?

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:46.510
Yep. Starts this Saturday.

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:50.250
It'll look bad for Hibiki-chan, if we're wearing dirty clothes.

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:50.970
See ya'.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.940
Old man! You'd better
watch your step.

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:03.170
Yes, yes, yes!

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:10.000
So the Director is coming? Who cares?

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:12.950
Parent's weekend is
important for a teacher.

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:14.460
I'll give them an amazing class!

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:19.940
Oh, Hibiki-sensei!

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:22.220
Oh, Kuzuha.

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:26.260
Kuzuha, are you all right?

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:28.410
Thanks sensei.

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:29.660
You're alone?

00:06:29.770 --> 00:06:31.290
They've got club activities.

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:33.690
Oh, let's walk together, then.

00:06:33.690 --> 00:06:35.670
You seem all fired up, sensei.

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:38.550
Well of course I am!

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:41.130
This will be my very first
parent weekend visit.

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:42.790
So let's do our best!

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:43.860
OK!

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:45.840
So, who's coming from your family?

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:47.450
Oh, nobody.

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:52.120
My father works overseas on
business and my mother...

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:54.910
My mother died when
I was six years old.

00:06:58.720 --> 00:06:59.520
I'm sorry.

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:01.430
Oh, no, not at all!

00:07:01.550 --> 00:07:02.720
It was a long time ago.

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:04.610
Besides, I like parent's weekend.

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:06.050
Please don't feel bad.

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:23.030
I got so carried away, I wasn't even
thinking about my students.

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:27.760
She's always smiling.

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:31.250
It's not doing any good just sitting here.

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:32.220
I have to get ready.

00:07:36.780 --> 00:07:37.650
Ba-chan!

00:07:39.170 --> 00:07:41.160
Do you think you can get me about 30 adult-

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:43.300
-size training
outfits by this Saturday?

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:44.820
What are they for?

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:47.040
For my version of parent's weekend.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:50.320
Mori Koji

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:49.930
What! It's parent's weekend!?

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:54.830
Excuse me, please continue.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:57.380
So, it's a must go then?

00:07:57.380 --> 00:07:58.720
I wouldn't miss it!

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:04.030
Saturday

00:08:01.030 --> 00:08:03.650
Oh no! I overslept!

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:11.040
Fuko, what are you doing?

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:14.240
I'm sorry. You go ahead.
I'll be right there!

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:15.780
Hurry up!

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:32.010
It's gym class,
so they'll be at the track.

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:33.940
Kochi-san, you got the blanket?

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:35.260
I got it.

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:37.340
Well then, shall we go?

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:38.370
Yes.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:40.210
Excuse me. Can we help you?

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:42.380
We're here for parent's weekend.

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:43.390
To visit.

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:46.010
But it doesn't start
until this afternoon.

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:48.100
You gotta be fast to get the best seats.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:49.450
You know that.

00:08:51.470 --> 00:08:53.780
Excuse me sir, but are
you family members?

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:55.620
Yes, we're family.

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:57.100
Family.

00:09:15.980 --> 00:09:17.200
You're not getting away!

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:39.940
Kuzuha! That's dangerous!

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:42.040
But, I dropped my picture.

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:43.020
Picture?

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:48.000
It's of my mother!

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:50.300
That's why!

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:51.850
I understand!

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:19.810
Hey, that hurt, Mori-chan.

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:20.570
Yeah...

00:10:23.530 --> 00:10:27.610
I'll make the both of you
pay dearly for this!

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:33.630
Kuzuha, I'm sorry.

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:35.900
It's OK.

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:41.340
Kuzuha, you're a lot
stronger than you look.

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:43.410
You always keep a smile on your face.

00:10:43.610 --> 00:10:47.250
I was a real crybaby when I was little,
but my mother told me...

00:10:47.490 --> 00:10:49.350
"No matter what, always keep smiling."

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:51.490
That's why...

00:11:11.510 --> 00:11:15.650
In truth, Kuzuha must be
feeling really sad.

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:18.220
That picture is the closest...

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:20.490
thing she had to a parent visiting her.

00:11:21.620 --> 00:11:22.980
I have to do something!

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:27.140
Oh, Ba-chan.

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:29.010
Can you find out something for me?

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:30.610
Yeah, yeah.

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:32.100
Thanks a lot.

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:40.860
Ah, Principal!

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:43.640
What a wonderful weekend for a parent visit!

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:48.140
You never seem to miss the opportunity to visit.

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:51.520
Your enthusiasm is
quite admirable, Director.

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:55.470
Thank you, but I'd feel a bit more enthusiastic...

00:11:55.510 --> 00:11:58.820
if not every teacher
at this school was a woman.

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:11.360
Well, it's the second year,
Indigo class' turn this time, isn't it?

00:12:11.610 --> 00:12:13.930
Yes, they'll be having gym class.

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:16.020
Miho!

00:12:16.120 --> 00:12:17.460
Good luck!

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:20.800
This is more embarrassing
than I imagined!

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:21.920
Fujio!

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:22.890
Fight on!!

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:27.040
Now don't overwork yourself.

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:27.980
I won't.

00:12:28.130 --> 00:12:30.370
Don't worry mother, I'll be just fine.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:34.070
Please excuse my outfit.
I just got off work.

00:12:34.070 --> 00:12:35.020
Oh, man...

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:38.260
What's up with that?
What does your old-man do anyway?

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:39.270
Private eye.

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:40.740
Ah!

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:47.870
Hello everyone,
sorry to keep you waiting!

00:12:47.980 --> 00:12:51.220
We're almost ready to
start gym class, but before we do...

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:56.970
We're also putting a great deal of effort into PE.

00:12:57.810 --> 00:13:00.700
Family members, please change into these training outfits!

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:03.180
We'd like you to participate
in today's class!

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:05.080
Amawa-sensei!

00:13:05.080 --> 00:13:07.140
What is this nonsense?!

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:10.130
You can't learn anything
by just watching a gym class.

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:13.980
I'd like for the parents to actually
experience their child's education.

00:13:14.370 --> 00:13:16.190
You've completely lost your mind!

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:20.210
No, I think it's an interesting idea.
I'm all for it.

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:21.460
But Director!

00:13:21.590 --> 00:13:23.060
I'll do it, too!

00:13:23.270 --> 00:13:26.210
Listen everyone,
this Sensei is absolutely right.

00:13:26.210 --> 00:13:28.800
We should try it ourselves, to know what our kids learn.

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:29.820
Should we do it?

00:13:29.820 --> 00:13:30.870
Sure, let's try it!

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:33.000
I wonder if it'll be difficult...

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:40.350
This kind of parent's visit
is unheard of.

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:50.320
I still look pretty hot
in a buruma, huh?

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:52.010
How embarrassing.

00:13:52.170 --> 00:13:53.580
You won't beat me, Akira!

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:57.140
So that outfit was really
a disguise, after all.

00:13:57.300 --> 00:13:58.840
He's definitely a private eye.

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:01.390
OK, is everyone ready to begin?

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:03.820
Today we will start
with a marathon run!

00:14:03.890 --> 00:14:05.250
What?!

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:06.870
Oh, no!

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:08.080
No complaining.

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:11.550
Mothers and fathers, please follow your children and me.

00:14:14.050 --> 00:14:16.170
All right everybody, let's follow her.

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:18.020
Let's go you guys.

00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:19.420
Yeah, great.

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:23.680
It's a long-course.

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:26.790
Feel free to stop if gets
to be too much!

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:32.740
A student-parent marathon...

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:37.030
Kuzuha!

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:40.210
You can take all the time you need...

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:43.060
but I want you to complete the
course so don't give up.

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:45.650
OK?

00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:03.540
Miho! You can't beat me!

00:15:03.780 --> 00:15:05.680
C'mon, think of your age, mom!

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:13.870
Papa, you should stop smoking.

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:15.490
Yeah, you're right.

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:19.590
Hey there, Makoto...

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:20.920
Shiro...

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:40.030
Come on dad!
You gotta keep going!

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:44.190
Father, mother, are the both
of you all right?

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:44.940
Yes...

00:15:45.180 --> 00:15:47.430
We're doing fine. But perhaps...

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:50.400
We should take a short break.

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:51.310
Yes.

00:15:51.440 --> 00:15:52.810
We're taking a short break.

00:15:59.940 --> 00:16:01.980
What kind of course is this anyway?!

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:03.940
Akira, are you going to continue?

00:16:08.220 --> 00:16:09.880
Hey dad, are you OK?

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:13.450
Yeah. I just tripped. That's all.

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:19.410
This is wonderful!

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:21.830
True communication between
parent and child.

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:32.230
Oh, hello.

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:46.540
You won't beat me!!

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:51.100
You have to speed up, if want to finish.

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:52.640
I really went all out!

00:16:59.850 --> 00:17:00.790
Fuko.

00:17:03.310 --> 00:17:04.500
This beach...

00:17:05.430 --> 00:17:06.590
looks familiar.

00:17:07.070 --> 00:17:08.470
Fight on Fuko!

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:24.520
This place is...

00:17:44.310 --> 00:17:50.740
Touko Kuzuha

00:17:46.970 --> 00:17:47.910
You made it.

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:50.080
But sensei...

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:52.640
how did you know this place?

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:54.300
I have my ways.

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:56.410
Well, why don't you have a visit...

00:17:56.610 --> 00:17:57.760
with your mom.

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:10.000
Fuko...

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:12.020
Fuko...

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:20.170
If you cry, then everyone else will be sad, too!

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:25.220
No matter what, always keep smiling.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.090
I...

00:18:27.760 --> 00:18:30.780
I love your smile...

00:18:31.550 --> 00:18:32.740
more than anything else.

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:34.540
Understand?

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:40.780
Then smile for me.

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:44.220
Bigger...

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:46.970
Much bigger...

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:51.430
Yes. You're a good girl, Fuko.

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:54.560
Mother!

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:01.790
Sensei.

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:05.290
It's time for my parent visit.
I'm ready to start.

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:13.430
Here I come!

00:19:43.670 --> 00:19:44.570
Mother.

00:19:47.640 --> 00:19:49.140
You're watching me, aren't you?

00:20:02.870 --> 00:20:04.760
That was a wonderful class!

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:10.940
A school visit where the parents get to
share the class along with their kids.

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:12.740
I really enjoyed it!

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:17.280
That kyoshi, Amawa, is very
interesting, even if she is a woman!

00:20:25.980 --> 00:20:28.370
I guess I worked you a little
too hard back there.

00:20:48.650 --> 00:20:55.400
At the train station after school
that's where I look for you

00:20:48.650 --> 00:20:55.400
Hokago no eki kimi wo sagasu.

00:20:55.510 --> 00:21:04.760
With my racing heart
can I find you again today?

00:20:55.510 --> 00:21:04.760
Doki doki shiteru
kyo mo aeru kana?

00:21:19.930 --> 00:21:26.720
At this train station
I saw you many times before

00:21:19.930 --> 00:21:26.720
Eki no homu de
mikakete ta kimi.

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:33.610
But couldn't talk to you
Not at all

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:33.610
Hajime wa nanimo hanase nakatta.

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:40.460
Will I find you again tomorrow?

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:40.460
Moshimo ashita aetara iina?

00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:48.440
Maybe I'll have enough
courage to talk to you

00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:48.440
Youki dashite ieru kamone.

00:21:48.630 --> 00:21:55.570
Even if the sky cries

00:21:48.630 --> 00:21:55.570
Tatoeba sora ga namida shitemo...

00:21:55.570 --> 00:22:04.410
with your smile it's
a sunny day in my eyes

00:21:55.570 --> 00:22:04.410
kimi no egao de hitomi wa hareru yo.

00:22:16.870 --> 00:22:19.140
Alright, keep going at it you worthless slugs!

00:22:19.550 --> 00:22:22.190
If that picture washed ashore, it should be nearby.

00:22:22.830 --> 00:22:24.180
But I'm so tired...

00:22:24.180 --> 00:22:25.490
Yeah...

00:22:25.730 --> 00:22:27.290
No breaks allowed!

00:22:35.520 --> 00:22:36.610
Look carefully...

00:22:36.890 --> 00:22:38.300
Please stop!

00:22:38.490 --> 00:22:39.100
Hmm?

00:22:38.490 --> 00:22:53.560
Fifth Period "Wicked Dream Foundation"

00:22:39.100 --> 00:22:40.650
Himejima, what is it?

00:22:40.650 --> 00:22:42.770
That circle at the bottom of the screen...

00:22:42.770 --> 00:22:44.800
I was wondering when it started spinning.

00:22:44.800 --> 00:22:46.260
I don't know.

00:22:46.260 --> 00:22:47.680
It used to be still, didn't it?

00:22:47.680 --> 00:22:49.700
Why don't you ask our admirable viewers.

00:22:49.700 --> 00:22:52.640
Hey everyone!
Do you know when it started spinning?

00:22:52.640 --> 00:22:55.640
It has always been spinning, and yes I've considered creating a sign for it, but I just don't have the time.
This episode alone literally took me more than 6 hours, and that's just the subtitles.
